        "prompt": "$\\left(x^2+\\frac{2}{x}\\right)^3$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x^6+6x^3+12+\\frac{8}{x^3}$",
          "worked": "Use row 3 coefficients $1,3,3,1$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\left(x^2+\\frac{2}{x}\\right)^3&=(x^2)^3+3(x^2)^2\\left(\\frac{2}{x}\\right)+3x^2\\left(\\frac{2}{x}\\right)^2+\\left(\\frac{2}{x}\\right)^3\\\\\\left(x^2+\\frac{2}{x}\\right)^3&=x^6+6x^3+12+\\frac{8}{x^3}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 30
      },
      {
        "id": "p4-additional-35-38-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$\\left(\\frac{1}{x}-x\\right)^6$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": {
            "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
            "version": 1,
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "p4-q36-short-result",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
