          },
          "worked": "Use row 5 coefficients $1,5,10,10,5,1$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\left(\\frac{3x}{2}-\\frac{2}{3x}\\right)^5&=\\left(\\frac{3x}{2}\\right)^5+5\\left(\\frac{3x}{2}\\right)^4\\left(-\\frac{2}{3x}\\right)+10\\left(\\frac{3x}{2}\\right)^3\\left(-\\frac{2}{3x}\\right)^2\\\\&\\quad +10\\left(\\frac{3x}{2}\\right)^2\\left(-\\frac{2}{3x}\\right)^3+5\\left(\\frac{3x}{2}\\right)\\left(-\\frac{2}{3x}\\right)^4+\\left(-\\frac{2}{3x}\\right)^5\\\\\\left(\\frac{3x}{2}-\\frac{2}{3x}\\right)^5&=\\frac{243}{32}x^5-\\frac{135}{8}x^3+15x-\\frac{20}{3x}+\\frac{40}{27x^3}-\\frac{32}{243x^5}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
